# Three scratch windows in one workspace; walk the tab row and check focus and frames.
# Assumes the workspace they land in holds only them (true in the VM; on this Mac TextEdit lands
# on a row of its own unless the state file remembers it elsewhere — workspace-count says so).
open 3 as t
settle
# require: on this Mac, never walk a row that holds the user's own windows.
require same-workspace t1 t2 t3
require workspace-count t1 3
focus t1
settle
require active t1
expect layout t1 maximize
note focused as A
note frame A as full
expect onscreen A
shot start

run focus-window-right
settle
note focused as B
expect differs A B
expect frame B full
expect not-parked B
expect parked A

run focus-window-right
settle
note focused as C
expect differs A B C
expect frame C full
expect parked B

# Three steps round a three-tab row wraps back to the start.
run focus-window-right
settle
expect focused A
expect frame A full
expect parked C
expect onscreen A
